OL,3,GNEWSACambridge Folk Festival to be held
OL,4,Afor extra day
OL,5,
OL,6,FCambridge Folk Festival will be
OL,7,Fextended to three days next year,
OL,8,Fhaving previously been scaled back due
OL,9,Fto big financial losses.
OL,11,FEarly bird tickets are due to go on
OL,12,Fsale this Friday for the 2027 event,
OL,13,Fwhich will run from Friday, 30 July to
OL,14,FSunday, 1 August.
OL,16,FThe annual festival used to run over
OL,17,Ffour days, but a #320,000 loss in 2024
OL,18,Fled to it being cancelled in 2025 on
OL,19,Fits 60th anniversary year, before it
OL,20,Freturned last month for a two-day run.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,374,370,200,160,0,100
