OL,3,GNEWSACambridge Folk Festival to be held
OL,4,Afor extra day
OL,5,
OL,6,FMike Todd-Jones, Labour cabinet member
OL,7,Ffor communities at Cambridge City
OL,8,FCouncil, said: "We've listened closely
OL,9,Fto our audiences, and the message was
OL,10,Fclear ` they loved the festival and the
OL,11,Fweekend in Cherry Hinton, and want the
OL,12,FFriday evening back."
